          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 235247,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, let's kick off the Standardised SME Tax Compliance Review Program. To get started on T1, can everyone please share their current high-level steps for reviewing an SME tax file? I've started a document A1 to capture this, and my initial draft has about 7 steps. Let's try to consolidate our approaches.",
